comment.narrative:
- Chapters being finalized by the team based on outputs of AFOLU, transport, waste, energy and IPPU consultancies and results of ICA; Finalized chapter on inventory and mitigation scenario development for AFOLU and transport for the 4NC.
- Conducted virtual consultation meetings Vulnerability and Adaptation with key experts and stakeholders.
- Updating the TNA for the 4 priority sectors identified by stakeholders: energy, transport, agriculture, and water. The results will be reported in the 4NC.
- Recruited experts in energy, transport, wastewater and industrial processes for the preparation and review of the GHG inventory and mitigation of the 4NC and 4BUR.
- Coordinated with NAP-GSP on the preparation of a GCF proposal on NAP.
- Mainstreamed climate change and NDC targets in the Ministry of Agricultures 2020-2025 strategy, Agrical Project (Green plan/FAO), Cool-ME and Built-ME (MoEW/IKI), Energy Outlook report (MoEW/IRENA) National Cooling plan (NOU/UNDP), State of the Environment Report (IS project/UNDP), Water strategy (MoEW); National Environment and Heatlh strategy (MOPH, WHO), Assessment of Climate Change Impact on Lebanon Coastal Zone- (UNEP/Balamand/MoE), FLRM project (MOA/FAO, IKI); 
- Integrated LEAP result in the PWC NDC update model.
- Updated MISCA as per the new IPCC guidelines.
- Designed and published 8 Infographics (Agriculture, Energy, Forestry, Gender, General, GHG, Transport and Waste) on the website and in the newsletter;
- Developed a 1 minute clip on GHG emissions to be disseminated on Social Media;
- Developed a Carbon calculator for universities;
- Coordinated activities for the 2021 Climathon.

- GHG inventory for the year 2017 finalized for all sectors and compiled; 
- Lebanon BUR4 is finalized and submitted to the UNFCCC, including GHG inventory of year 2017, reporting on sectoral mitigation actions and reporting on support received and still needed;
- Vulnerability and impact of climate change chapter is initiated under the 4NC;
- Adaptation assessment and technology needs assessment exercise for the water and agriculture sector is initiated for the 4NC;
- Vulnerability assessment of the public health sector initiated for the 4NC;
- Infographics are designed and printed.
